<<~ ahu #/head>>

! Node Host

`node-host.ts` fixes the path roots the lararium node daemon walks and
declares the `CorpusSource` shape a corpus entry carries. It resolves the
package root, the bags root, and the repo root from stable references, so
every downstream stratum reads one path law.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/law>>

!! Law

`LARES_ROOT` resolves from `import.meta.url` (ESM) — `dirname(dirname(__dirname))`
climbs from the compiled module to its package root, `packages/lararium-node`.
`BAGS_ROOT` and `LARES_MEMES_ROOT` derive from `repoRoot` (imported from
`@lararium/mesh/node`): `BAGS_ROOT` joins `repoRoot` with `bags`, and
`LARES_MEMES_ROOT` names the `lares` bag under it. `REPO_ROOT` re-exports
`repoRoot` directly.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/schema>>

!! Schema (machine-readable)

```toml
# Source: packages/lararium-node/src/node-host.ts

# LARES_ROOT — dirname(dirname(__dirname)) from import.meta.url
lares-root = "packages/lararium-node"

# Derived from repoRoot (@lararium/mesh/node)
bags-root        = "<repoRoot>/bags"
lares-memes-root = "<repoRoot>/bags/lares"
repo-root        = "<repoRoot>"

# CorpusSource — the structural contract a corpus entry carries
[corpus-source]
name  = "string"
path  = "string"
bag   = "string"
quine = "true (optional)"
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/http-transport>>

!! HTTP Transport

```toml
# Source: packages/lararium-mcp/src/http.ts
default-port = 3737
default-host = "127.0.0.1"
mcp-path     = "/mcp"

# Env overrides
env-port = "LARARIUM_HTTP_PORT"
env-host = "LARARIUM_HTTP_HOST"

# Canvas bridge API paths (fetchCanvas targets in stdio.ts)
canvas-api-rooms = "/api/rooms"
canvas-api-fire  = "/api/fire"

# Write guard env
env-write-mode = "LARARIUM_WRITE_MODE"
write-mode-value-required = "enabled"
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/source>>

!! Source

`packages/lararium-node/src/node-host.ts` — Node-only path resolution
(`import.meta.url`, `@lararium/mesh/node`), not packageable as CJS.

```typescript
import { join, dirname } from "path";
import { fileURLToPath } from "url";
import { repoRoot } from "@lararium/mesh/node";

const __dirname = fileURLToPath(new URL(".", import.meta.url));
export const LARES_ROOT       = dirname(dirname(__dirname)); // packages/lararium-node
export const BAGS_ROOT        = join(repoRoot, "bags");
export const LARES_MEMES_ROOT = join(BAGS_ROOT, "@lares");
export const REPO_ROOT        = repoRoot;

export interface CorpusSource {
  name:   string;
  path:   string;
  bag:    string;
  quine?: true;
}
```

